SETUP
Plug in UR ethernet and camera USB. Set wired connect to UR (see UR website for wired connection settings)

Allocation top left
Viz top right
Driver/Gripper mid right
Control script bottom

Change target name in control script and allocation node
Tweak desired wrench in control script if wanted
colcon build. restart allocation. 

Open viz. Make sure object is recognized. 
Run control script and cut early (to pre-make topics and validate home position)
Sixth terminal. ros2 bag record -a

Adjust object of interest. Orientation shouldn't matter.
Move viz window to cover viz, driver, and gripper outputs. 
Run control script. Screencapture allocation, control script, and viz window. Should last OtOo 1:15 minutes.
Interrupt early if object goes out of bounds.
cancel rosbag and organize. 




